#
# 11g's reply to `begin :1 := 42; :2 := to_clob('mixed é'); :3 := 'abc'; end;`
# with a NUMBER, a CLOB and a VARCHAR OUT bind, each with its indicator
# (#2466): the NUMBER's value, the CLOB's ub4 length and locator, the
# VARCHAR's value, each followed by its indicator 0.
# Captured 2026-11-06 through tools/capture_proxy.py: an OCI 11.2 program
# (instant client 11.2, x86-64 Linux, the client charset AL32UTF8;
# OCILobCreateTemporary, OCIBindByPos and the like, called through ctypes) on
# Oracle 11g XE 11.2.0.2 with SERVER=POOLED, the DRCP pool started. The TTC
# payload, without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output; the offset
# column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
00000000  0b 01 05 93 03 00 00 00  00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000010  00 00 10 53 4f a0 fd 7f  00 00 00 00 e8 07 00 00  |...SO...........|
00000020  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000030  00 00 10 10 10 07 02 c1  2b 00 00 28 00 00 00 28  |........+..(...(|
00000040  00 26 00 01 82 08 80 03  00 02 00 00 5b 04 06 00  |.&..........[...|
00000050  00 00 00 02 03 69 00 0a  00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00  |.....i..........|
00000060  df 62 5e a8 f9 0a 92 d9  00 00 03 61 62 63 00 00  |.b^........abc..|
00000070  08 06 00 90 09 75 00 00  00 00 00 01 00 00 00 00  |.....u..........|
00000080  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000090  00 00 00 04 01 00 00 00  0f 00 01 01 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000a0  00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00  00 2f 00 00 00 00 00 00  |........./......|
000000b0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000c0  00 00 00 00 0f 00 00 01  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000d0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 20 f6 31 0a 00  |........... .1..|
000000e0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
000000f0  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
00000100  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  |................|
